  isBadDecision: 0
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'These are the words I would like to address to her, all that my heart
      wants to tell her since she left. '
  - speaker: 1
    text: " I just want her to be close to me. I don\u2019t want to lose her too,
      I won\u2019t be able to bear being permanently alone."
  - speaker: 0
    text: I promise to find it and give it to her.
